id: pm-csv-v9cs
title: "Fix joinContinuations whitespace, add action.yml to EXECUTABLE_PATHS, and skip value-flag args in isPublishCommand"
description: "Three review findings: (1) joinContinuations used \\s* which swallows blank lines and can merge two separate shell commands, hiding a publish from the audit. Fixed to [^\\S\\r\\n]* for horizontal-only whitespace. (2) EXECUTABLE_PATHS did not match action.yml/action.yaml composite action files, so publishes in those files were never audited. Added pattern. (3) isPublishCommand returned false on npm --tag run publish because run was read as a runner subcommand before publish was reached. Added VALUE_FLAGS set to skip flag values."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-29T03:49:37.260Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-29T03:49:47.490Z"
