completed_at: "2026-08-29T03:49:47.444Z"
author: pi-agent
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-29T03:49:41.584Z",pi-agent,"All three fixes implemented with regression tests. joinContinuations test added for blank-line separation, isPublishCommand tests added for --tag run publish and --tag=run publish forms."
close_reason: All three fixes implemented with regression tests and passing gates.
